## Alias

plot_conc_time_mean



## Usage

```r
plot_conc_time_mean(
  data,
  x_var,
  y_var,
  id_var,
  color_var,
  split_by = NULL,
  facet_by = NULL,
  shape_var = NULL,
  color_limit = 8,
  stat_type = c("arithmetic", "geometric"),
  errorbar = c("upper", "both"),
  x_units = NULL,
  y_units = NULL,
  x_lab = NULL,
  y_lab = NULL,
  color_lab = NULL,
  shape_lab = NULL,
  style = pkdemo_style(),
  blq = c("drop", "zero", "half_lloq"),
  lloq = NULL,
  mean_below_lloq = c("none", "zero", "missing")
)
```
